        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ives FS452-5 5\" Kickdown Door Holder</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis kickdown door holder mounts to the lower surface of the door to keep  it in an open position. You can flip it up in a locked position, and then flip it down when you want to have the door stay open.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese kickdown door stops are made of Solid Brass by Ives. It includes a non-skid easily replaceable rubber tip to protect the floor, and is supplied with new mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Ives FS452-5 5\" Kickdown Door Holder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Gap to Floor: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip: Black</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Spring</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
